; vp8.no — VP8 (lossy) bitstream decoder, byte-exact port of libwebp's
; reference C decoder (vp8_dec.c / tree_dec.c / quant_dec.c / frame_dec.c /
; dsp/dec.c / dsp/yuv.h / dsp/upsampling.c). No floating point: every fixed
; point constant and rounding matches libwebp so decoded pixels are identical
; to dwebp. Self-contained: exposes `decode` returning RGBA/RGB planes.

